	(text "PCB REVIEW: C12 (CIN) and C13 (COUT) are on B.Cu; move beside U1/L1 on F.Cu before fabrication.\nFollow RP2350 datasheet 6.3.8: short local power loop, paired GND vias, COUT-to-FB sense, marked L1 orientation.\nKeep top copper clear under L1 and layer-2 copper clear under L1/LX; the keepout alone does not fix the capacitor layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 50.8 0)
		(effects
